OL,1,Vk4                              G13/13
OL,2,Vj5{5jj5~sGMAN AND BOY IN BELFAST
OL,3,Vj5op0ozz5pGSHOOTING INCIDENTS
OL,5, A man has been shot dead by the Army in
OL,6, north Belfast.
OL,8,FPolice say they are investigating the
OL,9,Fincident in Upper Meadow Street, in the
OL,10,FNew Lodge area shortly after 1000 this
OL,11,Fmorning.
OL,12,F
OL,13,FEarlier a 15-year-old boy was injured
OL,14,Fin a shooting incident in west Belfast.
OL,15,F
OL,16,FA woman who lives nearby said a number
OL,17,Fof gunmen approached a house in the New
OL,18,FBarnsley area and fired several shots
OL,19,Fthrough a window, hitting the youth in
OL,20,Fthe back.
OL,22,D]F This Ceefax page is fromG04-09-92
